  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-modlist%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1089803/description_6e20f309-0422-42da-a13b-db2ac952cdac.png\"></a></p>\n<p>better modlist 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 的非官方 NeoForge 移植版，兼容 Synitra Connector 以及使用 Mod Menu 的 Fabric 模组。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在 1.20.1 版本中需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config Screen</a> 才能在游戏内正常使用配置功能</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>没有 better modlist&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dff69021-8e43-4b09-969a-7cdcd5d873f0.png\"></p>\n<p>有</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2cc81745-ce0a-4129-8ecc-467e300a0f6b.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
